# Postgres connection used by the test suite.
#
# The API tests are integration tests: they run against a REAL local Postgres
# with the demo seed applied (see apps/api/prisma/seed.ts), not a mock. Point
# this at a DEDICATED test database - the suite writes review events, memory
# states, litre events and flight rows. Never point it at your dev database.
#
# Set up the database this file names with:
#   pnpm --filter @ogwi/api run db:test:setup
#
# Run that in a shell with no DATABASE_URL exported. Node's --env-file does
# NOT override a variable that is already set in the environment, so an
# exported DATABASE_URL silently wins and the command targets THAT database
# instead of this one - including for `migrate deploy`.
#
# Defaults below match docker-compose.yml. If you run Postgres natively with
# different credentials, copy this file to .env.test and edit it.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://ogwi:ogwi@localhost:5432/ogwi_test?schema=public"
